WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:17.970
Tom hurried to the Royal Lab.

2
00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:28.190
"Cat, I must make a powder for Cook," he said.

3
00:00:28.494 --> 00:00:30.431
"It must work.

4
00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:33.330
Or Dirk will lock us in the Grim Dungeon!"

5
00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:37.550
"Tom, you have a good heart," Cat said.

6
00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:39.770
"I will help you."

7
00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:43.890
She helped Tom make a magic powder.

8
00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:59.270
"This should work," she said.

9
00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:04.130
The guests began to arrive at the castle.

10
00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:15.410
In the Royal Kitchen, Cook was tasting a sauce.

11
00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:19.350
"My sauce!" she cried.

12
00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:21.970
"It tastes terrible!"

13
00:01:23.110 --> 00:01:25.150
"Try this!" Tom said.

14
00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:28.870
He sprinkled magic powder into the sauce.

15
00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:34.580
A delicious smell filled the kitchen.

16
00:01:35.114 --> 00:01:42.927
"Wonderful!" Cook cried.

17
00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:44.830
"Put some on the vegetables.

18
00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:50.030
And the bread. And the meat. And the cake!"

19
00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:53.550
Tom sprinkled magic powder on everything.

20
00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:06.590
Even Dirk smiled when he smelled the food.

21
00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:15.150
The servants took the food to the Dining Hall.

22
00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:19.590
Tom and Cook peeked through the door.

23
00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:24.600
The king took the first bite. "Delicious!"

24
00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:28.850
The guests started to eat too.

25
00:02:28.851 --> 00:02:32.226
"Delicious!" they said.

26
00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:35.220
"The powder works!" Tom said.

27
00:02:35.652 --> 00:02:38.258
He was shocked.

28
00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:41.080
"Thank you, Tom," Cook said.

29
00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:43.840
The guests ate and ate.

30
00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:49.640
They finished all the food.

31
00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:53.080
The servants brought in cake for dessert.

32
00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:04.780
The guests ate that too.

33
00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:15.850
"Everything tastes so good!" the king cried.

34
00:03:18.328 --> 00:03:24.303
"Bring more food!"
